msgctxt "badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And so, if she was offering ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ relief from all that, perhaps ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫"
"he⟪k:6⟫ should accept it."
