"⟪k:0⟫E então, se ela estava ⟪k:1⟫Lhe ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫oferecendo alívio de tudo isso, talvez ⟪k:4⟫"
"Você⟪k:5⟫ele⟪k:6⟫ devesse aceitar."

#: badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdb7d001952794fd3ba65496b020adf5a4464f060b2e9adbb08209c6a9754b41
