"⟪k:0⟫Ela ⟪k:1⟫Te guiou⟪k:2⟫o guiou⟪k:3⟫ até aqui, sem nunca soltar ⟪k:4⟫Sua⟪k:5⟫sua⟪k:6⟫ mão."

#: badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382
